    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 56,
      "leaf": "右十六下、左十七上",
      "reading": "石勒使人夜排牆填殺之，衍年五十六。王敦之語與顧愷之畫贊後記子玄。",
      "source_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/NLC016-HWRB201817005-3303_%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8_%E4%B8%80%E7%99%BE%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E5%8D%B7_%E9%9F%B3%E7%BE%A9%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%B7_%E7%AC%AC12%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=56",
      "capture_sha256": "79c1bafbd2f8ec14ca9560c0b979557923f039e50df8b96202bc910afcecb07d"
